    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ali'wiv'anga ku'poma na Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nawe wendeleyaga na musi'nzo gwakwe. Yav'aga aho wav'age ali' mu nzi'la, haho wav'ipami'ki'zyaga v'amalaika v'amwa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aho wav'awonaga wayombaga ati', “Yeni'yi' yi'li' nkambi' ya v'asilikale yamwa Mulungu!” Hu' nguno wahitanaga henanho “Mahanaimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muhayo “Mahanaimu” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “nkambi' iv'i'li' zya v'asilikale.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene wav'atu'maga v'akombe v'amutongelele ku' muku'lu'ye Esau, u'yo wav'age ikalile ku' lwandi' lwa ngu'lu' zya Seili ku' nsi' ya Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wav'awi'laga ati', “Yagi mukamuwi'le gu'ku' wanne Esau i'vi: Mukumba wako Yakobo ali'yomba ati', ‘Ku' itungo lyose nikalaga wu'geni ku'mwa Labani mpaka lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni'nazyo ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo, mbu'li na v'akumba v'a ki'ki'ma na v'a ki'gosya. Gi'si' nu'ku'tu'mi'la nkombe, ev'e gu'ku' wanne, ki'gele u'nanuku'le mpandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele ya minso gako.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'akombe v'enav'o v'ayaga ku'mwa Esau. Aho v'amali'laga ku'mupa mmola, v'asu'v'aga ku'mwa Yakobo na ku'yomba, “Kwafikaga ku' muku'lu'yo Esau na ku'mufiki'zya mmola i'yo wali' waku'tu'maga, nawe Esau ali' mu nzi'la. Izile ku'ku'su'mbi'la na mbuto ya v'agosya magana ane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo wogohaga na ku'nywagala muno. Hohene wav'agawu'laga v'antu' v'akwe av'o v'av'age haki'mo nawe, na madale ga nkolo, mbu'li, ng'ombe na ntwangawu'lende, gose gafumaga madale av'i'li' av'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiganikaga ati', “U'lu' ize Esau, ali'gwi'li'le idale li'mo, hohene idale li'ngi' li'ku'pu'lu'gu'ka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yakobo wamulombaga Mulungu ati', “Ev'e Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu na Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne Isaka, ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo ndi' wambwi'la nsu'v'e ku' nsi' yanne, na ku' igongo lyanne, ndi' wayomba u'lambezezye wu'soga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ene nkafiki'i'lile chelu' na nhana yose i'yo wambezezizye ene mukumba wako. Aho nav'age nu'ki'lania mongo gwenu'gu' gwa Yolodani nav'age ni'na mulanga du' mu makono ganne, ali'vi gi'si' ni'nago madale av'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu'ku'lomba u'mpi'zye ku'fuma mu makono ga muku'lu' wanne Esau, ku'nguno nu'wogoha, akowolile kwiza ku'ku'gwi'li'la ene, v'aki' v'anne, haki'mo na v'ana v'anne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ev'e wayombile ati', ‘Nhana ndaku'v'ezezye wu'soga, na wu'v'yalwa wako ndawingi'hye ki'ti' musengasenga gwa mu nyanza, u'go gu'kakowoleka ku'v'azyi'ka.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo walalaga henanho wu'ziku' wenu'wo. Hangi' wakomaga lwandi' lwa nsawo yakwe, ki'gele yi'v'e lu'holo ku' muku'lu'ye Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasogolaga mbu'li nki'ma magana av'i'li' na ngulati' maku'mi av'i'li', nkolo nki'ma magana av'i'li' na ng'ondi maku'mi av'i'li', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ntwangawu'lende maku'mi adatu' i'zyo zili'wonsya haki'mo na ndama zyazyo, ng'ombe nki'ma maku'mi ane na nzagamba iku'mi, mpunda nki'ma maku'mi av'i'li' na ngosya iku'mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho wav'apaga v'akumba v'akwe, ki'la yu'mo na idale lyakwe, na wav'awi'laga ati', “Muntongelele na muv'e muli'leka lyelemo hagati' ya idale na idale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuwi'laga u'yo atongelile, “U'lu' wapoma na muku'lu' wanne Esau nawe mbe waku'wu'zya, ‘Ev'e u'li' mukumba wamwa nde? U'yile ku'he? Mitugo zyeni'zi zyamwa nde?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene u'ku'su'v'ya, ‘Yeni'yi' nsawo ya mukumba wako Yakobo, na lwenu'lu' hu' lu'li' lu'holo ku' wako, ev'e gu'ku' wanne Esau. Nawe Yakobo mweni'ki'li' ali' ku' nnuma izile.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wamuwi'laga mukumba wa idale lya wu'v'i'li', na lya wu'datu', na v'ose av'o v'av'age v'alondile madale na ku'yomba, “I'vi hu' i'vyo muku'muwi'la Esau u'lu' mwapoma nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' mulav'i'le ku'muwi'la ati', ‘Mukumba wako Yakobo ali' ku' nnuma, aku'londile.’ ” Yakobo wayombaga vyeni'vyo, ku'nguno wiganikaga ati', “U'lu' natongezyaga lu'holo, itungo i'lo ku'ku'v'a kwiwona nawe minso ku' minso hamo aku'v'a watekanaga na aku'nanuku'la.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene watongezyaga lu'holo lwakwe, ali'vi mweni'ki'li' walalaga henanho ha nkambi' wu'ziku' wenu'wo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wikinde wamwa Yakobo na Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu'ziku' wenu'wo Yakobo watunu'laga, wav'asolaga v'aki' v'akwe v'av'i'li', masuli'la v'akwe v'av'i'li', na v'ana v'akwe iku'mi na yu'mo, nawe wav'av'i'tyaga ha muv'i'to gwa mongo gwa Yaboki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wav'av'i'tyaga ha muv'i'to, wav'i'tyaga hangi' na nsawo zyakwe zyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo wasigalaga inene henanho. Hohene wizaga muntu' yu'mo, haho v'idimaga miv'anda mpaka ndiyu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' mwenu'yo aho wawonaga ku'v'a akakowola ku'mukinda Yakobo, wamukumyaga ha kafyu'fyu' ka ha itango, haho Yakobo watyegu'kaga kafyu'fyu' ka itango lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Ndeku'li'le nje ku'nguno yi'li' ikingilima.” Ali'vi Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nkakowola ku'ku'leku'li'la u'ye mpaka u'ndosye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwu'zyaga, “Lina lyako u'li' nde?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene ni' Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwi'laga ati', “U'kav'e u'li'witanwa hangi' Yakobo, ali'vi u'ku'v'a u'li'witanwa Izilaeli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Izilaeli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu ali'wigu'maga.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ku'nguno wikindaga na Mulungu na v'antu' v'angi' nanho wakindaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo wayombaga, “Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa mbwi'le lina lyako u'li' nde?” Ali'vi muntu' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga, “ku' ki' u'li'mbu'zya lina lyanne?” Haho wamudosyaga kwenu'ko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo wahitanaga henanho “Penueli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Penueli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'syu' wa Mulungu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” ku'nguno wayombaga, “Nawu'wonaga wu'syu' wamwa Mulungu ku' minso ganne ali'vi nkafwile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yakobo wav'age ali'wu'ka henanho ha Penueli na ku'v'i'ta mongo, lyu'v'a lyasangwa lyadodomoka, nawe wav'age ali'sunta ku'nguno ya ku'tyegu'ka kafyu'fyu' ka itango lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya V'aizilaeli mpaka walelo v'akalyaga musipa gwa itango ha kafyu'fyu', ku'nguno muntu' mwenu'yo wakuumya kafyu'fyu' kamwa Yakobo henanho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
